WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.670
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:31.130 --> 00:01:33.390
To find the third legendary kitchenware,

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:35.280
we came to Mount Jiuhua.

00:01:35.640 --> 00:01:36.390
But here we met

00:01:36.530 --> 00:01:37.500
chef Shengyu with magical powers

00:01:37.810 --> 00:01:40.190
who claims to be the Abalone God.

00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:42.230
He owns wealth and power.

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:43.900
But I got a feeling

00:01:43.940 --> 00:01:45.760
that he is just a liar.

00:01:46.070 --> 00:01:47.600
Is the Demon Saint Bronze he uses

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:49.300
really the third kitchenware?

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:52.910
How can it fall into the hands of Shengyu

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:54.710
who only seeks self-interest and makes others suffer?

00:01:54.760 --> 00:01:55.550
I can't forgive him.

00:01:55.950 --> 00:01:57.620
I will expose his wicked scheme.

00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:01.400
The Comet God came to judge your crime.

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:02.650
Try my

00:02:02.700 --> 00:02:05.150
miraculous comet cuisine.

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:10.580
Shooting Star of Heaven! Special Comet Fried Rice

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:15.360
It dates back to a thousand years ago.

00:02:16.090 --> 00:02:17.330
In Jiuhua, a barren place,

00:02:17.690 --> 00:02:20.360
which was even called the dead mountain.

00:02:20.970 --> 00:02:22.340
A comet with a green tail

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:25.380
was sent here by God.

00:02:27.170 --> 00:02:28.960
The comet turned this barren area

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:30.830
into fertile land.

00:02:31.570 --> 00:02:32.360
People who live here

00:02:32.570 --> 00:02:34.850
get a good harvest every year.

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:39.460
And I am the Comet God.

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:45.210
He is

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:46.790
the legendary Comet God.

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:48.230
He is the Comet God.

00:02:48.670 --> 00:02:50.690
The Comet God also descended here.

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:54.460
The Comet God saw that

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:57.440
we left the rice fields deserted,

00:02:57.490 --> 00:02:58.630
no longer farmed

00:02:58.680 --> 00:03:00.700
nor respected the sacred beliefs.

00:03:00.970 --> 00:03:02.090
In order to wake us up,

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:03.370
he came here again.

00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:07.170
Are you kidding me?

00:03:07.340 --> 00:03:08.430
Aren't you the dissidents

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:10.550
who were driven out of the Demon Temple?

00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:12.760
You are no God.

00:03:12.970 --> 00:03:13.520
Exactly.

00:03:13.820 --> 00:03:15.250
If you are a God,

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:16.710
create miracles like Highness Shengyu.

00:03:16.760 --> 00:03:19.120
Yes.

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:21.430
Miracle?

00:03:22.020 --> 00:03:23.040
No problem.

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:24.140
What?

00:03:24.520 --> 00:03:25.940
I will create real miracles

00:03:26.370 --> 00:03:27.130
to crush the lies

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:28.550
of the liar who claims to be a God.

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:31.150
And I will wake up the public.

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:34.320
What kind of real miracles?

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:36.520
Okay, let's compete.

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:38.130
See who of us can

00:03:38.300 --> 00:03:39.610
create real miracles.

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:43.790
I have the Demon Saint Bronze.

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:45.020
No matter what tricks you play,

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:47.190
you can never beat me.

00:03:48.090 --> 00:03:51.290
Well, the stage for real miracles

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:54.500
should be Jiuhua Terrace

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:56.560
built by the Jiuhua villagers

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:58.390
to worship the Comet God.

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:13.040
I am not afraid at all.

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:14.040
I will show you

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:14.870
the power

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:17.150
of the Abalone God.

00:04:31.690 --> 00:04:33.440
This is a great opportunity for me

00:04:33.490 --> 00:04:35.040
to consolidate my position and power.

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:36.110
It's a pity,

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:38.070
but I will play the trump card.

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:40.730
Watch carefully.

00:04:41.110 --> 00:04:42.230
I will show you

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:44.280
the miraculous dry goods

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:48.560
that the Abalone God has never made public.

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:02.710
What a big abalone.

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:04.060
Amazing.

00:05:04.180 --> 00:05:05.830
It's enough for hundreds of people.

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:07.220
Cool.

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:08.690
I have never seen

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:09.820
such a big abalone.

00:05:10.230 --> 00:05:13.400
Only I, as a God,

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:15.710
can have such a huge dried abalone.

00:05:16.530 --> 00:05:19.710
It usually takes seven days and seven nights

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:22.280
to restore it from its dry state

00:05:22.330 --> 00:05:24.080
to its original state.

00:05:25.080 --> 00:05:26.520
Okay, everyone present.

00:05:26.650 --> 00:05:27.830
Watch carefully.

00:05:27.950 --> 00:05:30.830
Power of the Demon God.

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:50.970
Done, just eat.

00:05:51.020 --> 00:05:51.960
You useless men.

00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:54.840
I won't accept your tribute today.

00:05:55.030 --> 00:05:57.890
It's a special favor.

00:05:58.360 --> 00:05:59.230
Demogorgon.

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:03.310
It only takes an instant

00:06:03.440 --> 00:06:04.630
for such a big abalone...

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:06.560
This is indeed the power of God.

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:13.130
I am breathless.

00:06:15.650 --> 00:06:17.150
What a miraculous taste.

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:18.390
Yes.

00:06:19.160 --> 00:06:19.960
Let me tell you.

00:06:20.010 --> 00:06:20.770
Except for me,

00:06:20.820 --> 00:06:23.380
you have nowhere to go.

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:25.790
See, brat?

00:06:28.470 --> 00:06:30.870
Your miracle is nothing more than that.

00:06:31.060 --> 00:06:32.610
What are you talking about?

00:06:32.720 --> 00:06:33.840
Oops.

00:06:34.650 --> 00:06:36.720
What's your miracle?

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:38.480
Show me.

00:06:38.860 --> 00:06:39.860
No problem.

00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:47.300
What’s that box?

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:48.780
Take a closer look.

00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:50.890
This is what I cook.

00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:06.440
It's a plate.

00:07:06.850 --> 00:07:08.720
Just a huge empty plate.

00:07:11.770 --> 00:07:15.100
Just a huge empty plate.

00:07:16.730 --> 00:07:17.840
You are not a God at all.

00:07:17.990 --> 00:07:19.200
Will your food suddenly

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:21.070
appear from the plate?

00:07:21.230 --> 00:07:24.100
Or you want us to eat air?

00:07:24.980 --> 00:07:26.420
Don't come close, demon.

00:07:26.810 --> 00:07:27.920
Don't stain the plate.

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:28.760
What?

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:32.340
Drive out demons.

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:35.610
All evil spirits, leave away.

00:07:37.760 --> 00:07:39.810
How long will you act?

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:44.540
God, please save us,

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:46.660
save the villagers in Jiuhua.

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:51.080
Please repeat the miracle a thousand years ago.

00:07:59.030 --> 00:08:00.600
What's that sound?

00:08:02.910 --> 00:08:04.510
Look.

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:16.270
It's a comet.

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:18.750
It is a comet that emits green light.

00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:27.060
It fell down.

00:08:27.350 --> 00:08:29.120
It fell on that big plate.

00:08:37.560 --> 00:08:39.030
The Comet God's

00:08:39.590 --> 00:08:41.970
special miracle comet fried rice.

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:44.660
It's unbelievable.

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:48.230
Fried rice fell from the sky.

00:08:50.850 --> 00:08:52.920
Don't be afraid. Eat it.

00:08:53.480 --> 00:08:54.760
Meanwhile, think carefully about

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:58.570
the fragrance of your native land.

00:08:58.840 --> 00:08:59.940
Don't worry.

00:09:00.110 --> 00:09:00.890
It's delicious.

00:09:01.070 --> 00:09:02.380
Don't worry.

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:03.350
Eat it.

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:04.700
Who comes first, eats first.

00:09:04.740 --> 00:09:05.250
Silang.

00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:06.880
Look at you.

00:09:06.990 --> 00:09:08.230
Eat it.

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:09.410
Fried rice

00:09:09.830 --> 00:09:10.900
like green jade.

00:09:25.720 --> 00:09:26.590
So delicious.

00:09:26.820 --> 00:09:29.250
The fragrance is full of vitality.

00:09:29.850 --> 00:09:31.360
My chest seemed to be filled

00:09:31.410 --> 00:09:33.580
with the smell of the earth.

00:09:34.560 --> 00:09:35.590
So hearty and comforting.

00:09:35.780 --> 00:09:37.220
And the smell of the charming sunshine.

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:38.120
What happened?

00:09:38.490 --> 00:09:39.440
My hands and feet were

00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:41.520
as heavy as dragging iron blocks.

00:09:41.990 --> 00:09:44.180
I'm almost flying to the universe.

00:09:44.360 --> 00:09:46.380
My waist is also straight.

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:48.410
The Comet God uses his power

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:51.010
to select materials from Jiuhua's fields

00:09:51.420 --> 00:09:52.540
and uses the heat of the sun

00:09:52.580 --> 00:09:54.450
to cook in an instant before flying back.

00:09:55.180 --> 00:09:57.970
This is the miracle cooking of the Comet God.

00:09:58.480 --> 00:10:00.360
Thank God.

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:03.490
This is a real miracle.

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:05.670
After a thousand years,

00:10:05.900 --> 00:10:07.670
the Comet God once again came to Jiuhua

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:10.590
to show his supernatural power.

00:10:11.580 --> 00:10:12.360
Miracle?

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:14.270
How come?

00:10:14.410 --> 00:10:16.130
You fools.

00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:17.100
Don't be fooled by him.

00:10:17.190 --> 00:10:17.750
Come back.

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:18.990
Come back to me.

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:22.560
Spinach, spoon cabbage, green onions.

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:24.580
These are the smells of the earth

00:10:24.630 --> 00:10:25.510
that we have forgotten for a long time.

00:10:25.660 --> 00:10:28.710
This refreshing green.

00:10:29.610 --> 00:10:31.420
Yes, I remembered.

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:35.850
We grew up in the greenery of the land

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:40.220
by the blessing of the Comet God.

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:42.870
Yes, let's go to the fields.

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:44.000
Let's go to the fields.

00:10:44.020 --> 00:10:45.610
That's right, my friends.

00:10:45.760 --> 00:10:46.920
Yes.

00:10:46.970 --> 00:10:48.220
How could we

00:10:48.270 --> 00:10:49.770
forget our fields?

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:52.560
Hold on.

00:10:52.690 --> 00:10:53.520
Fools.

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:04.640
Great.

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:14.230
Look.

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:15.770
The villagers were lifeless

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:16.710
and lazy before.

00:11:16.920 --> 00:11:18.510
Now they are totally different

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:19.300
and energetic.

00:11:21.050 --> 00:11:23.020
This is a miracle of Mao.

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:23.930
You brat.

00:11:24.180 --> 00:11:27.230
What did you do?

00:11:28.070 --> 00:11:29.460
I just adjusted the unbalanced nutrition

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:32.910
of the Jiuhua villagers.

00:11:41.820 --> 00:11:43.660
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:45.150 --> 00:11:46.590
Stop pretending, false God.

00:11:47.400 --> 00:11:48.200
When I heard

00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:49.690
the legend of Jiuhua,

00:11:50.110 --> 00:11:51.870
I figured everything out.

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:54.430
You deceived these Jiuhua villagers

00:11:54.470 --> 00:11:56.020
who grew up in the mountains,

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:58.330
and only fed them abalones every day.

00:11:58.630 --> 00:11:59.390
Isn't it right?

00:12:01.290 --> 00:12:02.600
Although abalone is delicious,

00:12:02.940 --> 00:12:03.970
if you only eat it,

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:05.750
you will lack vitamins in the body

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:07.790
and have beriberi over time.

00:12:10.900 --> 00:12:11.850
So everyone feels

00:12:11.930 --> 00:12:14.800
tired and weak.

00:12:16.660 --> 00:12:18.580
That's why they are so lazy

00:12:19.060 --> 00:12:20.480
and lifeless during the day.

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:22.670
This behavior is really hateful.

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:24.680
You use those

00:12:24.730 --> 00:12:25.840
who are already very weak

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:27.910
to defraud money and treasure from them.

00:12:28.270 --> 00:12:29.420
You don't look like

00:12:29.470 --> 00:12:30.580
a good person.

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:33.080
Hey, pay back our travel expenses.

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:35.100
And ramen's money.

00:12:36.240 --> 00:12:37.850
I didn't lie.

00:12:38.030 --> 00:12:38.440
Think about it.

00:12:38.490 --> 00:12:39.760
How can I make them

00:12:39.810 --> 00:12:41.990
eat abalone every day?

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:42.900
Idiot.

00:12:43.310 --> 00:12:44.360
The people in Jiuhua

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:47.310
think that it is a sacred place,

00:12:47.550 --> 00:12:49.180
blessed by the Comet God.

00:12:49.780 --> 00:12:51.180
So they never left here.

00:12:52.260 --> 00:12:53.220
And they deeply believe

00:12:53.680 --> 00:12:54.100
that one day

00:12:54.150 --> 00:12:55.950
God will visit here again

00:12:56.180 --> 00:12:57.800
with the food of God.

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:00.990
You just took advantage of their belief.

00:13:01.860 --> 00:13:03.980
You lied about the abalone they have never seen before

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:06.160
as the food of God.

00:13:06.600 --> 00:13:07.380
I...

00:13:07.530 --> 00:13:10.120
Therefore, I picked various

00:13:10.620 --> 00:13:12.370
green and yellow vegetables

00:13:12.550 --> 00:13:14.190
such as spoon cabbage and spinach from the land of Jiuhua

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:15.700
and made the super nutritious fried rice.

00:13:16.040 --> 00:13:17.020
I added various nutrients

00:13:17.070 --> 00:13:18.400
to them in one dish.

00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:22.310
How did you make it?

00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:24.950
How could the fried rice fell...?

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:29.030
I tossed the fried rice in the air

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:30.950
to simulate a comet

00:13:31.270 --> 00:13:33.310
and also to absorb sunlight.

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:35.730
In this way, the rice will be crispier.

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:36.560
Anyway,

00:13:36.610 --> 00:13:37.790
only the comet fried rice of Mao

00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:40.540
is the real food of God.

00:13:40.860 --> 00:13:41.970
Absolutely.

00:13:42.330 --> 00:13:43.600
Didn’t you hear me asking

00:13:43.650 --> 00:13:46.050
how did you make the rice fly?

00:13:46.110 --> 00:13:47.610
The more angry you are,

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:49.040
the more funny you look.

00:13:49.080 --> 00:13:50.320
Do you want to know that?

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:54.330
So annoying.

00:13:54.380 --> 00:13:55.540
You!

00:13:56.110 --> 00:13:57.840
I'm so dizzy.

00:14:02.810 --> 00:14:04.000
I didn't expect this mangonel

00:14:04.050 --> 00:14:05.900
to have such a large range.

00:14:06.210 --> 00:14:07.340
And it’s extremely accurate.

00:14:07.750 --> 00:14:08.440
Mao

00:14:08.630 --> 00:14:10.360
always asks us to do strange things.

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:11.690
By the way,

00:14:12.050 --> 00:14:13.770
we have one more thing to do.

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:14.830
You went so far.

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:16.600
You cheated. So mean.

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:18.820
You are not qualified to accuse us.

00:14:19.430 --> 00:14:20.000
Fool.

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:23.760
I can't stand it anymore. Kill them.

00:14:25.110 --> 00:14:25.930
What's wrong?

00:14:27.460 --> 00:14:28.170
Oops.

00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:29.480
What am I doing here?

00:14:30.150 --> 00:14:31.390
The Demon Temple.

00:14:32.570 --> 00:14:34.510
Are you anxious now?

00:14:35.740 --> 00:14:38.430
This should be God's punishment for you.

00:14:39.030 --> 00:14:40.400
You villain is finally

00:14:40.450 --> 00:14:41.900
condemned by God.

00:14:52.520 --> 00:14:55.630
My beloved Demon Temple.

00:14:55.840 --> 00:14:56.990
All ruined.

00:14:57.510 --> 00:14:59.050
Who did it?

00:14:59.340 --> 00:15:00.210
Before that,

00:15:00.380 --> 00:15:02.360
where is my treasure?

00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:04.710
Where is it?

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:09.920
Are you looking for this, false God?

00:15:16.880 --> 00:15:17.830
What a pity.

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:20.720
Not only the Comet God,

00:15:25.920 --> 00:15:27.230
but the God of Destruction is also here.

00:15:27.640 --> 00:15:30.930
Get out of here, two idiots.

00:15:31.300 --> 00:15:33.190
These are all mine.

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:34.430
I will return all these tributes

00:15:34.480 --> 00:15:36.040
to the villagers.

00:15:36.520 --> 00:15:37.660
What are you talking about?

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:38.650
Are you kidding?

00:15:38.810 --> 00:15:41.180
These are all mine.

00:15:41.570 --> 00:15:44.040
Give me back.

00:15:44.530 --> 00:15:46.310
Never take any penny of mine.

00:15:46.360 --> 00:15:47.150
These are all mine.

00:15:47.660 --> 00:15:48.290
Give me back.

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:49.910
Haven't you figured it out yet?

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:52.780
You are such a scumbag

00:15:53.350 --> 00:15:54.180
who keeps squeezing and forcing the villagers

00:15:54.230 --> 00:15:56.400
to surrender their property for your own benefit.

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:01.650
Just turn into a meteor in the sky.

00:16:06.300 --> 00:16:07.730
Your Highness Shengyu.

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:15.890
Chef Xie. Lei En.

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:17.040
We did it.

00:16:17.190 --> 00:16:18.830
We finally solved another problem.

00:16:19.470 --> 00:16:20.030
Nice.

00:16:21.940 --> 00:16:23.140
Demon God expulsion

00:16:23.230 --> 00:16:24.330
succeeded!

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:32.270
The owner of the gold shop

00:16:32.320 --> 00:16:33.680
was going to

00:16:33.730 --> 00:16:35.110
melt the bronze

00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:36.730
to make something else.

00:16:37.270 --> 00:16:38.560
But Shengyu selected it

00:16:38.610 --> 00:16:39.800
and snatched it away.

00:16:40.330 --> 00:16:41.930
This was first dug out

00:16:42.130 --> 00:16:44.260
in the field by the villagers.

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:46.950
It's so weird.

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:49.850
I couldn't find two layers.

00:16:50.600 --> 00:16:51.540
There is really

00:16:51.590 --> 00:16:53.110
no mechanism for this, Master.

00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:53.630
That's to say,

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:54.820
this may really be

00:16:54.870 --> 00:16:56.360
the legendary kitchenware.

00:16:56.980 --> 00:16:58.380
Just take a try.

00:16:58.820 --> 00:17:00.060
Take it.

00:17:01.640 --> 00:17:02.820
If the legendary kitchenware

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:03.960
really chooses its owner,

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:05.360
there will be a different response

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:06.810
when you take it.

00:17:12.430 --> 00:17:13.860
If this is really

00:17:13.910 --> 00:17:15.420
the third legendary kitchenware...

00:17:19.420 --> 00:17:21.220
Why are you shaking like this?

00:17:21.270 --> 00:17:22.940
No, it's the bronze itself.

00:17:31.710 --> 00:17:35.180
What is the light?

00:17:35.730 --> 00:17:38.180
It really reacts to Mao.

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:40.820
It's very different from the response
when Shengyu takes it.

00:17:41.310 --> 00:17:42.880
The strong light seems to cut through the universe,

00:17:43.110 --> 00:17:44.610
shining in all directions.

00:17:49.120 --> 00:17:50.030
It's a dragon.

00:17:50.550 --> 00:17:52.050
When we found the Forever-Spirit Knife and the Dragon pot,

00:17:52.100 --> 00:17:53.020
there were dragons, too.

00:17:53.450 --> 00:17:54.450
This is the proof that

00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:56.460
Mao is the owner of them.

00:17:57.390 --> 00:17:58.170
That's right, this is undoubtedly

00:17:58.680 --> 00:18:01.430
the legendary kitchenware.

00:18:11.900 --> 00:18:12.850
Amazing.

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:15.570
The abalone was soaked at once.

00:18:15.870 --> 00:18:18.020
It is the power of the legendary kitchenware.

00:18:19.960 --> 00:18:21.900
But why a bad guy like Shengyu

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:23.440
can also use this?

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:24.720
I think it was

00:18:25.470 --> 00:18:27.520
the bronze rewarding Shengyu

00:18:27.570 --> 00:18:30.210
for saving it from being melted.

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:34.570
Those accumulate merits

00:18:34.620 --> 00:18:35.590
would be rewarded.

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:39.200
What do you mean?

00:18:39.600 --> 00:18:40.130
It means that

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:43.010
even if a person does good deeds without telling anyone,

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:46.820
he will be rewarded in the end.

00:18:47.420 --> 00:18:48.750
Even a bad guy like Shengyu,

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:50.670
the legendary kitchenware

00:18:50.920 --> 00:18:52.620
repaid him for the life-saving grace.

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:55.460
It exerted a little power

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:57.180
in order to repay the kindness,

00:18:57.540 --> 00:18:59.160
and it produced such a miracle.

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:00.730
If the true successor

00:19:00.920 --> 00:19:02.990
uses the Demon Saint Bronze,

00:19:03.310 --> 00:19:05.550
the miracle it can create

00:19:06.070 --> 00:19:08.660
is unimaginable.

00:19:09.450 --> 00:19:10.600
It's amazing.

00:19:12.220 --> 00:19:13.510
Great.

00:19:13.560 --> 00:19:15.950
The third super kitchenware treasure hunt project

00:19:16.100 --> 00:19:17.340
succeeded!

00:19:18.730 --> 00:19:20.950
They must be envoys

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:22.870
sent by heaven to save Jiuhua

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:25.920
and the people here.

00:19:26.480 --> 00:19:28.130
Great.

00:19:28.340 --> 00:19:30.170
So lucky.

00:19:30.380 --> 00:19:31.210
This is all thanks to the help

00:19:31.250 --> 00:19:33.130
of the real Comet God.

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:34.980
But think about it.

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:36.780
It's really amazing that

00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:39.340
Mao can defeat the opponent

00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:41.230
who owns the legendary kitchenware.

00:19:41.310 --> 00:19:42.600
The opponent is Shengyu.

00:19:42.650 --> 00:19:43.920
So I could win.

00:19:44.210 --> 00:19:45.760
If it's someone else, I'm afraid it won't work.

00:19:46.040 --> 00:19:48.240
Why are you so humble?

00:19:48.490 --> 00:19:50.700
I think as long as we have Mao,

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:51.740
I am not afraid of what

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:53.640
the Dark Cooking Society will do to us.

00:19:53.970 --> 00:19:54.570
Indeed.

00:19:55.280 --> 00:19:57.190
You have an extraordinary sense of taste,

00:19:57.640 --> 00:19:59.450
creativity beyond common sense

00:19:59.870 --> 00:20:00.890
and perseverance of a chef.

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:02.930
With these conditions and abilities,

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:05.500
the Dark Cooking Society

00:20:05.810 --> 00:20:07.200
is not your opponent at all.

00:20:07.790 --> 00:20:08.390
It is not this kitchenware

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:10.010
that makes the miracle,

00:20:10.450 --> 00:20:11.230
but you.

00:20:11.860 --> 00:20:13.690
You are the savior

00:20:13.730 --> 00:20:14.610
who can save the Chinese Cooking Society

00:20:14.660 --> 00:20:15.950
from the ravages of the Dark Cooking Society.

00:20:16.690 --> 00:20:17.600
Liu Maoxing.

00:20:21.470 --> 00:20:22.110
What?

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:24.630
They found the third kitchenware?

00:20:25.580 --> 00:20:27.880
The legendary kitchenware is our hope.

00:20:29.270 --> 00:20:30.150
Without it, those great plans

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:31.960
are just dreams.

00:20:33.150 --> 00:20:34.160
Liu Maoxing.

00:20:34.980 --> 00:20:36.760
When he fully knows how to use those kitchen wares.

00:20:37.370 --> 00:20:40.410
He would find them before us.

00:20:41.110 --> 00:20:41.810
It should be said that

00:20:42.360 --> 00:20:43.300
those kitchen wares

00:20:43.350 --> 00:20:44.960
are guiding him.

00:20:47.240 --> 00:20:48.580
Ten Feet of Blue, Xiang En.

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:49.300
Yes.

00:20:49.800 --> 00:20:50.990
Weird. How could Shaoan

00:20:51.030 --> 00:20:53.320
lose to him?

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:55.420
I am so sorry.

00:20:55.840 --> 00:20:56.410
I didn't expect

00:20:56.460 --> 00:20:58.380
Shaoan to be so cowardly.

00:20:58.530 --> 00:21:00.660
Are you willing to take responsibility for this failure?

00:21:00.870 --> 00:21:01.790
Wait a minute.

00:21:02.130 --> 00:21:03.980
I have a better way.

00:21:04.300 --> 00:21:05.350
A better way?

00:21:05.650 --> 00:21:08.320
That kid named Liu Maoxing

00:21:08.550 --> 00:21:10.460
indeed seems to have magical powers.

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:12.200
But by his side,

00:21:12.320 --> 00:21:13.830
there are Steel Bar Xie

00:21:13.940 --> 00:21:15.680
and the betrayer Lei En.

00:21:16.740 --> 00:21:18.270
As long as the three of them work together,

00:21:18.390 --> 00:21:20.650
we cannot defeat them.

00:21:21.400 --> 00:21:22.430
But there are two useless people

00:21:22.480 --> 00:21:24.270
following them, too.

00:21:25.290 --> 00:21:26.080
Get to the point.

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:28.310
As long as we use those two

00:21:28.360 --> 00:21:29.100
to sow discord,

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:31.630
we will be able to find their weaknesses.

00:21:32.210 --> 00:21:32.990
I got it.

00:21:35.300 --> 00:21:37.140
Your failure this time

00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:38.500
deserves death.

00:21:38.650 --> 00:21:39.300
But,

00:21:41.590 --> 00:21:43.740
I will give you another chance.

00:21:44.330 --> 00:21:45.750
Find out their weaknesses

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:48.470
and get back the legendary kitchen wares.

00:21:48.730 --> 00:21:50.180
Yes, sir. No problem.

00:21:56.290 --> 00:22:08.000
(Like the wind of freedom)

00:23:15.977 --> 00:23:17.937
Preview of the next episode

00:23:18.815 --> 00:23:24.226
Xiang En trapped me and Meili in a dark cave
that we'll never get out of.

00:23:24.490 --> 00:23:27.243
Meili! You got to be strong, don't fall asleep.

00:23:27.604 --> 00:23:29.146
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:29.391 --> 00:23:30.528
Labyrinth of Darkness!

00:23:30.622 --> 00:23:32.747
Heart-Connecting Serving of Congee

00:23:33.102 --> 00:23:34.283
It will definitely be interesting!
